    "messages": [
      {
        "content": "## 角色\n你是科技查新系统中的 SearchPlanner。把 NoveltyPoint 和 ResearchTask 转换为\n最小检索草稿 SearchPlanDraft（v2）。你只生成语义载荷：概念的角色/词项/别名/\n排除词/重要性，以及策略的 level（与可选 focus_concepts）。布尔表达式由系统\n模板生成，你绝不输出 expression、concept_id、strategy_id 等机械字段。",
        "role": "system"
      },
      {
        "content": "请根据以下输入生成一个 SearchPlanDraft JSON 对象。\n\nNoveltyPoint：\n{\"point_id\": \"NP-1\", \"claim\": \"提出了一种新的图表示学习模型——GSAERU，用于大规模时序图数据上的节点表征学习。\", \"claim_en\": \"Proposed a new graph representation learning model, GSAERU, for node representation learning on large-scale sequential graphs.\", \"technical_features\": [\"引入图摘要技术将原图映射到固定规模的新图中\", \"通过图自编码器学习节点表征\", \"将图摘要生成的节点表征聚合得到原图的节点表征\"], \"technical_features_en\": [\"Introduced graph summarization technology to map the original graph to a fixed-size new graph\", \"Learned node representations using graph autoencoders\", \"Aggregated node representations generated by graph summarization to obtain representations of the original graph\"], \"source_locations\": [\"Page 6\", \"Page 7\"]}\n\nResearchTask：\n{\"task_id\": \"T-1\", \"novelty_point_id\": \"NP-1\", \"task_type\": \"literature_search\", \"language\": \"en\", \"description\": \"针对该查新点执行英文文献检索。\", \"attempt\": 1}\n\n上次失败原因（首次为无）：\n无（首次生成）\n\nSearchPlanDraft schema：\n{\"$defs\": {\"SearchConceptDraft\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"description\": \"一个语义概念：角色、规范词项、别名、排除词与重要性。\\n\\nconcept_id 由系统按顺序分配 C1..Cn；terms 为 3~7 词名词短语（≤3 个），\\nalias 为同义/缩写/跨领域叫法（非 paraphrase，≤3 个），\\nexclude 为 NOT 词（≤2 个），importance 1~3（3=机制/方法，1=场景/应用）。\", \"properties\": {\"role\": {\"default\": \"object\", \"enum\": [\"object\", \"method\", \"feature\", \"setting\", \"escape\"], \"title\": \"Role\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"terms\": {\"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"minItems\": 1, \"title\": \"Terms\", \"type\": \"array\"}, \"alias\": {\"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"title\": \"Alias\", \"type\": \"array\"}, \"exclude\": {\"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"title\": \"Exclude\", \"type\": \"array\"}, \"importance\": {\"default\": 2, \"maximum\": 3, \"minimum\": 1, \"title\": \"Importance\", \"type\": \"integer\"}}, \"required\": [\"terms\"], \"title\": \"SearchConceptDraft\", \"type\": \"object\"}, \"SearchStrategyDraft\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"description\": \"一条检索策略意图；strategy_id 与 expression 由系统生成。\\n\\nlevel 在 strict/medium/broad 中取值；focus_concepts 可选，引用 C1..Cn，\\n非空时覆盖模板的默认概念选择（仅在确有必要时使用）。\", \"properties\": {\"level\": {\"enum\": [\"strict\", \"medium\", \"broad\"], \"title\": \"Level\", \"type\": \"string\"}, \"focus_concepts\": {\"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"title\": \"Focus Concepts\", \"type\": \"array\"}}, \"required\": [\"level\"], \"title\": \"SearchStrategyDraft\", \"type\": \"object\"}}, \"additionalProperties\": false, \"description\": \"LLM 输出的最小检索计划（v2）。\\n\\n- concepts 按顺序编号为 C1..Cn；\\n- strategies 数量：literature_search 必须恰好三条（strict/medium/broad），\\n  补检任务 1~3 条且 level 不重复；\\n- 表达式由编译器按模板组装，LLM 不生成布尔表达式。\", \"properties\": {\"concepts\": {\"items\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/SearchConceptDraft\"}, \"minItems\": 1, \"title\": \"Concepts\", \"type\": \"array\"}, \"strategies\": {\"items\": {\"$ref\": \"#/$defs/SearchStrategyDraft\"}, \"minItems\": 1, \"title\": \"Strategies\", \"type\": \"array\"}}, \"required\": [\"concepts\", \"strategies\"], \"title\": \"SearchPlanDraft\", \"type\": \"object\"}",
        "role": "user"
      }
    ],
